<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-page="natural-motion-lab" data-theme="atlas-celadon">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <title>001 青瓷雨 · 自然动效实验室</title>
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=7"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=7">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/celadon_rain_lab.css?v=4">
</head>
<body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#celadonStage">跳到动效舞台</a>

    <header class="lab-header">
        <a class="lab-back" href="/tools">← 返回工具</a>
        <p><span>ARCHIVE NO. 001</span><strong>CELADON RAIN LAB</strong></p>
        <a class="lab-archive" href="/tools/visual-themes">查看主题图鉴 ↗</a>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="lab-intro" aria-labelledby="labTitle">
            <div>
                <p class="lab-kicker">东方器韵 · 光雨实验</p>
                <h1 id="labTitle">青瓷雨</h1>
            </div>
            <p>先把一场雨做对。风不是单一方向，雨不是平面线条，水面会记住每次碰撞，瓷釉与环境光在波纹中缓慢偏移。</p>
        </section>

        <section class="celadon-stage" id="celadonStage" data-render-state="loading"
                 data-celadon-asset="/images/visual-symbols/visual-symbols-01.webp"
                 aria-label="001 青瓷雨 WebGL2 动效样板">
            <canvas id="celadonCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

            <div class="stage-status" id="stageStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">
                <span class="status-mark"></span>
                <strong id="stageStatusTitle">正在初始化 WebGL2</strong>
                <small id="stageStatusDetail">准备风场、水面和青瓷纹理。</small>
            </div>

            <div class="depth-scale" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>FAR / 雾雨</span>
                <span>MID / 雨帘</span>
                <span>NEAR / 溅落</span>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-title" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>雨洗青瓷釉面</span>
                <strong>CELADON<br>AFTER RAIN</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-instruments">
            <details class="lab-controls" open>
                <summary>环境参数 <span>LIVE</span></summary>
                <div class="control-body">
                    <label for="windControl">
                        <span>风场</span><output id="windValue">1.00</output>
                    </label>
                    <input id="windControl" type="range" min="0" max="2" value="1" step="0.05">

                    <fieldset class="wind-compass" id="windCompass" data-direction="west"
                              style="--wind-flow-angle: 0deg">
                        <legend>
                            <span>风向</span>
                            <output id="windDirectionValue">西风 W → E · 270°</output>
                        </legend>
                        <div class="wind-compass__dial">
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--north" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="north" data-wind-angle="0"
                                    aria-label="北风 0°，N → S" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>北</strong><small>N→S</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--northeast" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="northeast" data-wind-angle="45"
                                    aria-label="东北风 45°，NE → SW" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>东北</strong><small>NE→SW</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--east" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="east" data-wind-angle="90"
                                    aria-label="东风 90°，E → W" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>东</strong><small>E→W</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--southeast" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="southeast" data-wind-angle="135"
                                    aria-label="东南风 135°，SE → NW" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>东南</strong><small>SE→NW</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--south" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="south" data-wind-angle="180"
                                    aria-label="南风 180°，S → N" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>南</strong><small>S→N</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--southwest" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="southwest" data-wind-angle="225"
                                    aria-label="西南风 225°，SW → NE" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>西南</strong><small>SW→NE</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--west" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="west" data-wind-angle="270"
                                    aria-label="西风 270°，W → E" aria-pressed="true">
                                <strong>西</strong><small>W→E</small>
                            </button>
                            <button class="wind-direction wind-direction--northwest" type="button"
                                    data-wind-direction="northwest" data-wind-angle="315"
                                    aria-label="西北风 315°，NW → SE" aria-pressed="false">
                                <strong>西北</strong><small>NW→SE</small>
                            </button>
                            <span class="wind-compass__needle" aria-hidden="true"><i>→</i></span>
                        </div>
                        <p id="windDirectionDetail">气象角度 270° · 来自西方，向东方流动。</p>
                    </fieldset>

                    <label for="rainControl">
                        <span>雨量</span><output id="rainValue">1.00</output>
                    </label>
                    <input id="rainControl" type="range" min="0.15" max="1.8" value="1" step="0.05">

                    <div class="control-actions">
                        <button id="impactButton" type="button">单次落滴</button>
                        <button id="pauseButton" type="button" aria-pressed="false">暂停</button>
                        <button id="resetButton" type="button">重置</button>
                    </div>
                    <p>移动指针改变局部风向；点击水面可直接注入一次碰撞。</p>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details class="light-controls" id="lightInstrument"
                     data-breathing="on" data-tyndall="on" open>
                <summary>光场观测 <span>OPTICS</span></summary>
                <div class="light-control-body">
                    <label for="lightControl">
                        <span>环境光</span><output id="lightValue" for="lightControl">1.00</output>
                    </label>
                    <input id="lightControl" type="range" min="0.45" max="1.35" value="1" step="0.05">

                    <section class="light-effect light-effect--breathing" aria-labelledby="breathingTitle">
                        <header>
                            <span><strong id="breathingTitle">呼吸光</strong><small>釉面与水面反射</small></span>
                            <button class="effect-toggle" id="breathingToggle" type="button"
                                    aria-pressed="true">开启</button>
                        </header>
                        <div class="effect-sliders">
                            <label for="breathStrengthControl">
                                <span>呼吸幅度</span><output id="breathStrengthValue" for="breathStrengthControl">0.12</output>
                            </label>
                            <input id="breathStrengthControl" type="range" min="0" max="0.35" value="0.12" step="0.01">
                            <label for="breathPeriodControl">
                                <span>呼吸周期</span><output id="breathPeriodValue" for="breathPeriodControl">8.0 s</output>
                            </label>
                            <input id="breathPeriodControl" type="range" min="4" max="16" value="8" step="0.5">
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="light-effect light-effect--tyndall" aria-labelledby="tyndallTitle">
                        <header>
                            <span><strong id="tyndallTitle">丁达尔光</strong><small>雨雾中的体积散射</small></span>
                            <button class="effect-toggle" id="tyndallToggle" type="button"
                                    aria-pressed="true">开启</button>
                        </header>
                        <div class="effect-sliders">
                            <label for="tyndallStrengthControl">
                                <span>散射强度</span><output id="tyndallStrengthValue" for="tyndallStrengthControl">0.55</output>
                            </label>
                            <input id="tyndallStrengthControl" type="range" min="0" max="1.2" value="0.55" step="0.05">
                            <label for="tyndallAngleControl">
                                <span>入射方向</span><output id="tyndallAngleValue" for="tyndallAngleControl">右上 28°</output>
                            </label>
                            <input id="tyndallAngleControl" type="range" min="-60" max="60" value="-28" step="1">
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </details>
            </div>

            <p class="stage-caption"><span>WATER MEMORY / 01</span>每颗雨滴都向高度场写入一次能量。</p>
        </section>

        <section class="quality-notes" aria-labelledby="qualityTitle">
            <header><p>QUALITY SAMPLE</p><h2 id="qualityTitle">当前只验收这四件事</h2></header>
            <dl>
                <div><dt>风</dt><dd>多尺度流场与阵风通过空间传播，而非整幅同步倾斜。</dd></div>
                <div><dt>雨</dt><dd>远、中、近三层拥有独立的视差、速度、线径和虚化。</dd></div>
                <div><dt>水</dt><dd>碰撞会生成水冠与传播波，波面法线继续扭曲倒影。</dd></div>
                <div><dt>光</dt><dd>呼吸只调制真实受光材质；丁达尔光束穿过雨雾，并被青瓷器物柔和遮挡。</dd></div>
            </dl>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/celadon_rain_lab.js?v=4" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
